<title>SWEDEN: Astra denies Roche purchase rumour.</title>
<headline>Astra denies Roche purchase rumour.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish pharmaceuticals concern Astra AB on Thursday denied market rumours that Swiss drugs giant Roche was interested in buying the Swedish company.</p>
<p>Astra leapt eight crowns to 322.5 crowns on the rumour, which Astra said was not true.</p>
</text>
